{title: Moonlight}
{artist: Grace VanderWaal}
{album: Just the Beginning}
{key: Am}

{start_of_verse label="Intro"}
[Am][G][D5][D]
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse}
[Am]She always has a smile
[G]From morning to the [D5]night[D]
[Am]The perfect poster child
[G]That was once in my [D5]life[D]
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse label="Pre-Chorus"}
[Am]A doll made out of glass
[G]All her friends think that she's [D5]great[D]
[Em]But I can see through it [D]all
[C]And she's about to break
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus}
[Am]Remember last year when you told [G]me
[D]To always stay here and never leave [Em]me
[Am]The light from your eyes made it feel [G]like
[D]We-e-e-e were dancing in the [Em]moonlight

[Am]Remember last year when you told [G]me
[D]That these will be lifelong [Em]stories
[Am]The light from your eyes made it feel [G]like
[D]We-e-e-e were dancing in the [Em]moonlight
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_verse label="Post-Chorus"}
[Am]     [G]     [D]     [Em]
(Ooh-ooh ooh, ooh ooh, ooh - ooh - ooh)
You-ou-ou-ou were dancing in the moonlight
[Am]     [G]     [D]     [Em]
(Ooh-ooh ooh, ooh ooh, ooh - ooh - ooh)
And I-I-I-I was dancing in the moonlight
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse}
[Am]Now she lost her way
[G]And she forgets to [D]smile
[Am]Never gets a break
[G]From this life in [D]denial
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse label="Pre-Chorus"}
[Am]A doll made out of glass
[G]All her friends think that she's [D5]great
[Em]But I can see through it [D]all
[C]And she's about to break, oh!
{end_of_verse}

{chorus}

{start_of_verse label="Post-Chorus"}
[Am]     [G]     [D]     [Em]
(Ooh-ooh ooh, ooh ooh, ooh - ooh - ooh)
You-ou-ou-ou were dancing in the moonlight
[Am]     [G]     [D]     [Em]
(Ooh-ooh ooh, ooh ooh, ooh - ooh - ooh)
And I-I-I-I was dancing in the moonlight
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_bridge}
[Em]I, I, I, miss those [G]memories[Am]
[Em]We used to share just you and [C]me[Cm]
{end_of_bridge}

{start_of_chorus}
[Am]I remember last year when I told [G]you
[D]I would always stay here and never leave [Em]you
[Am]I told you the light in your eyes made it look [G]like
[D]We-e-e-e were dancing in the [Em]moonlight

